window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Experience one of television's greatest science-fiction series, <i>The Twilight Zone</i> - fully dramatized for audio! Featuring a full cast, music and sound effects, and today’s biggest celebrities in modern radio dramatizations. </p> <p>A man travels back in time to the date of President Lincoln's assassination in the hope of saving him. Will his presence have any impact at all and can he actually change history?</p>"; 
